{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_calendar_lag7_audit", "label": "The calendar_lag7 audit \u2014 one real defect, one live ruler conflict", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_harness_reported_basis", "label": "harness.REPORTED_BASIS = 'calendar_lag7'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A documented project standard chosen for comparability across the pre-registration chain \u2014 a hard-coded literal here is not a bug, and a session hunting them all would have 'fixed' forty correct call sites."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_config_venue_scale_basis", "label": "config.VENUE_SCALE_BASIS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The post-G2 per-venue ruler; every module written after G2 reads it, and it is the more defensible basis because the plain basis is deflated by structural zeros."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_narrower_defect_criterion", "label": "The real defect class is a scaled metric at an unscaled venue", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The ledger's audit criterion was miscopied, which is why a fourth file felt inevitable; re-audited on the correct criterion there is no fourth file."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_ruler_conflict_24_percent", "label": "Two live rulers disagreeing by up to 24%", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A MASE quoted in this project without naming its basis is ambiguous by up to 24%, and MASE values from different chapters are not directly comparable. Not resolved: which basis the dissertation quotes is a methodology decision and a human gate."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_flag_mase_ruler_recurrence", "label": "FLAG-MASE-RULER, one level up", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Report 42 removed three private copies of the denominator that disagreed by up to a factor of two; the disagreement moved up a level into two public constants."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_tournament_truncation_bug", "label": "Tournament arms truncated the horizon before predicting", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The intent is to restrict the scoring window, not what the model is asked to forecast, so the probe now predicts the full horizon and masks for scoring \u2014 a behaviour change recorded rather than folded in silently."}, {"id": "brain_log_69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result_provenance_stamping_applied", "label": "provenance.runtime_stamp() wired into interval_calibration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/69_basis_audit_and_ruler_conflict_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "aut